# Windows launchers. CRLF because every Windows tool that touches them
# expects it, and the .ps1 files must keep their UTF-8 BOM — Windows
# PowerShell 5.1 decodes a BOM-less script in the system ANSI code page,
# which corrupts every non-ASCII string in it.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
# Generated icons are binary; never touch their bytes.
*.ico binary
*.png binary
